@SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Health check
GET {{SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Ricerca catalogo spazi (tutti gli spazi attivi)
GET {{SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress}}/spaces
Accept: application/json

### Ricerca catalogo con filtri combinati (tipo, modalità, capienza minima, strumenti, software)
GET {{SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress}}/spaces?type=Lab&mode=Dedicated&minCapacity=20&equipment=videoprojector&software=Docker
Accept: application/json

### Dettaglio singolo spazio per ID
GET {{SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress}}/spaces/3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Accept: application/json

### Verifica prenotabilità spazio (Aula 101 - disponibile)
GET {{SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress}}/spaces/3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bookable?from=2026-10-28T09:00:00Z&to=2026-10-28T11:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Verifica prenotabilità spazio con manutenzione (Aula 205)
GET {{SmartCampus.Spaces.Api_HostAddress}}/spaces/3f2a9c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000008/bookable?from=2026-10-28T09:00:00Z&to=2026-10-28T11:00:00Z
Accept: application/json
